From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukas Voegl <lvoegl@tdt.de>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:26:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] meig: implement MeiG ASR plugin

Implements a plugin for ASR based MeiG modems using shared MeiG utilities.

Signed-off-by: Lukas Voegl <lvoegl@tdt.de>
---
